    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目主题：聊聊成为玄学命理师应该具备哪些条件，命理师给人咨询应该注意什么？有什么讲究的地方？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期时间线：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 玄学命理师与医生有什么相似之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 命理师也讲究望闻问切么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 什么才是真正的推演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 命理师与出马仙的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">08:12</a> 命理师哪些能讲，哪些不能讲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a> 给人看命会五弊三缺么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a> &nbsp;预测中最重要，却最被忽视的点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a> 命理师怎样做才是积德行善</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="924">15:24</a> 命理师如何面对负能量</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>《行运超人》栏目</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>玄学指路，行运超人</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是一档玄学聊天的节目，主要聊聊玄学六爻、八字、风水民俗文化，侃一侃人生哲学智慧，每周三、六两更。</span></p><span></span><p><span>想看往期节目内容文字版，可查看：</span><a href="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/homepage?__biz=Mzg2ODIxODIyNw==&amp;hid=7&amp;sn=ac6e02e61ba022350ebf1e91f92e5a38&amp;scene=18#wechat_redirect" data-url="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/homepage?__biz=Mzg2ODIxODIyNw==&amp;hid=7&amp;sn=ac6e02e61ba022350ebf1e91f92e5a38&amp;scene=18#wechat_redirect"><span>《行运超人》文字版</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主讲人</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>馆长：易门新奇国学馆馆长，易学世家，传统文化讲师，20余年学易理论实践，擅长六爻、八字、风水，多家上市公司顾问。</span></p><span></span><p><span>执事：行运超人主理人，前腾讯资深咨询师，玄学与哲学爱好者，学易10余年。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>欢迎链接</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>有咨询需求，可添加馆长助理爻妹微信：YiMenxqg01</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多玄学干货分享，可关注公众号：易门新奇国学馆</span></p><span></span><p><span>福利领取：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2ODIxODIyNw==&amp;mid=2247489390&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=bc863eafb6c3ca78853e325f3f7dcd12&amp;chksm=ceaef372f9d97a64b61ee57d7f4c7c249a699e561ffabc4e01ceb6a52b272c3bf58a7e058430&amp;token=1330801491&amp;lang=zh_CN#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2ODIxODIyNw==&amp;mid=2247489390&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=bc863eafb6c3ca78853e325f3f7dcd12&amp;chksm=ceaef372f9d97a64b61ee57d7f4c7c249a699e561ffabc4e01ceb6a52b272c3bf58a7e058430&amp;token=1330801491&amp;lang=zh_CN#rd"><span>易学古籍书</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/homepage?__biz=Mzg2ODIxODIyNw==&amp;hid=4&amp;sn=95344529f56bc163859fc837db3fb4c7&amp;scene=18#wechat_redirect" data-url="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/homepage?__biz=Mzg2ODIxODIyNw==&amp;hid=4&amp;sn=95344529f56bc163859fc837db3fb4c7&amp;scene=18#wechat_redirect"><span>漫画易经</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/homepage?__biz=Mzg2ODIxODIyNw==&amp;hid=1&amp;sn=1127979f4c523838a16b115cdf91278a&amp;scene=18" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/homepage?__biz=Mzg2ODIxODIyNw==&amp;hid=1&amp;sn=1127979f4c523838a16b115cdf91278a&amp;scene=18"><span>白话六爻</span></a><span>系列公开课，欢迎领取！</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢本期节目的听友，可以点赞、评论支持下哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎在评论区告诉我们，你喜欢听的、想听的玄学内容。</span></p>]]></description>
